1235
01:13:31,720 --> 01:13:35,057
To the most faithful, to our glorious dead.

1236
01:13:36,016 --> 01:13:37,893
Charles Sloane...

1237
01:13:38,185 --> 01:13:40,228
Wilfred Bell...

1238
