1292
01:17:46,224 --> 01:17:47,224
Open it!

1293
01:17:47,267 --> 01:17:48,747
My husband may be back there, please!

1294
01:17:48,852 --> 01:17:49,978
There's nothing left,

1295
01:17:50,270 --> 01:17:51,396
even if you could get off!

1296
